  "title": "Deterministic Aerospace Manufacturing & NRE Quotation Costing",
  "label": "ASSUMPTION",
  "equation": "raw_mass = finished_mass_kg * buy_to_fly_ratio; direct_cost = raw_mass * material_unit_cost_eur_kg * part_quantity + machining_hours_per_part * machining_rate_eur_hr * part_quantity + engineering_setup_hours * engineering_rate_eur_hr + tooling_nre_eur + ndt_qa_cost_per_part_eur * part_quantity; total_cost = direct_cost * (1 + overhead_pct/100 + risk_contingency_pct/100); quoted_total = total_cost / (1 - target_margin_pct/100).",
  "note": "Deterministic Decimal quotation costing model. Rate cards, buy-to-fly ratios, contingencies, and margin targets are explicit ASSUMPTION/ESTIMATE inputs; never generated by an LLM.",
